        "original_id": "b97298ba-792b-587a-8465-2bb5b24192d6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Wenling, Xinzheng, Wuyantou, Taizhou, Zhejiang, Zhengzhou, Henan, China\n- Organizations: Jiangxia Tidal Power Station, SIAS International University\n\nFacts:\n- Wenling is a coastal county-level city in the municipal region of Taizhou in southeastern Zhejiang province, China.\n- Xinzheng is a small county-level city of Zhengzhou in the south of Henan province in Central China.\n- The Jiangxia Tidal Power Station is the fourth largest tidal power station in the world and is located in Wuyantou, Wenling City, Zhejiang Province, China.\n- SIAS International University is located in the ancient city of Xinzheng near Zhengzhou, the capital of Henan.",
